1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,618
Mana bu — ZAMIN FK stadioni.

2
00:00:02,638 --> 00:00:04,258
Uni muxlislar to‘ldiradi.

3
00:00:04,278 --> 00:00:06,758
Va ulardan birida — sizning ismingiz!

4
00:00:06,778 --> 00:00:09,657
Har bir obunachi — bitta virtual muxlis.

5
00:00:09,677 --> 00:00:11,420
Stadionda bitta o‘rin.

6
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,887
Ismingiz — o‘z o‘rningizda turadi.

7
00:00:13,907 --> 00:00:16,394
Izohga yozing: men shu yerdaman!

8
00:00:16,414 --> 00:00:19,775
Har yangi qismda stadion qanday to‘layotganini ko‘rasiz.

9
00:00:19,795 --> 00:00:23,239
Videoni to‘xtating — o‘zingizni olomonda tasavvur qiling.

10
00:00:23,259 --> 00:00:25,911
Birinchi vazifa: stadionni to‘ldirish!

11
00:00:25,931 --> 00:00:28,551
Besh yuz muxlis bilan u mana shunday bo‘ladi.

12
00:00:28,571 --> 00:00:30,591
Hozir esa — uch yuz besh.

13
00:00:30,611 --> 00:00:32,663
Yana bir yuz to‘qson besh kishi kerak!

14
00:00:32,683 --> 00:00:34,930
Ellik kishi — to‘la avtobus.

15
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:37,170
Besh yuz kishi — butun maktab!

16
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:40,169
Birinchi besh yuz muxlis — klubning asoschilari.

17
00:00:40,189 --> 00:00:42,363
Keyingi qurilishni ham siz tanlaysiz.

18
00:00:42,383 --> 00:00:44,403
Do‘stingiz futbolni yaxshi ko‘radimi?

19
00:00:44,423 --> 00:00:45,437
Unga ulashing!

20
00:00:45,457 --> 00:00:48,583
Obuna bo‘ling — joyingiz stadionda kutmoqda.

